// Ch15 B12 "Let me carry him." (E, 3 min). act2_ch15.md §2 B12. H09: a jetty at mid-morning; Liss alone,
// washing Tobin's hand; Toma comes down the jetty and stops at a distance, then closer. The 1003 Brine
// Shoals burning: nobody needed to know (Ivo is dead); he tells her anyway, and that makes it a choice.
// RULE 7: his faith breaks here, out loud, ONCE; no "Be level" again in Act II. H10: Liss doesn't forgive
// him (she never says it). The choice to let him carry Tobin is HERS, not the player's: no prompt. She
// steps back from the board. H11: Toma carries Tobin, cloth and all; Liss beside him with her hand on the
// cloth; Rhen falls in on Toma's other side if he gave Ivo the answer at Corrow.
title: ch15_let_me_carry_him
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
@letterbox on
@camera H09
@anim liss wash_hand tobin
@mark toma confess_toma walk
@wait 3.0
Toma [sad]: Liss. There is something I have to say to you, and then I will go. #line:ch15_carry_001
@wait 2.0
Toma [guilty]: In 1003 I was on the line at a camp in the Brine Shoals. A salvage camp. Like yours. #line:ch15_carry_002
@wait 2.0
Toma [guilty]: I was twenty-two. I held the torch. I did not throw it. I tell myself that is different. It is not. #line:ch15_carry_003
<<if $ch09_toma_knelt_with_ivo>>
    Toma [grief]: The man beside me at the shoals threw his. He is in the sea at Corrow now. I asked her to take him gently. #line:ch15_carry_004 #long
<<endif>>
<<if $ch14_toma_refused>>
    Toma [determined]: I have said 'Be level' every morning of my life. I did not say it to my commander. I am not going to say it again. #line:ch15_carry_005 #long
<<else>>
    Toma [determined]: I have said 'Be level' every morning of my life. I am not going to say it again. #line:ch15_carry_006
<<endif>>
<<set $ch15_toma_confessed = true>>
@camera H10
@anim liss wash_hand tobin
@wait 3.0
Liss [cold]: I know what a camp looks like after. I've stood in two. #line:ch15_carry_007
@wait 3.0
Liss [grief]: I'm not going to say it's all right. #line:ch15_carry_008
Toma [grief]: Let me carry him. Please. I don't ask you to forgive me. Let me carry him. #line:ch15_carry_009
@wait 4.0
@anim liss step_back
@wait 2.0
@camera H11
@anim toma lift tobin
@mark toma jetty_end_toma walk
@mark liss jetty_end_liss walk
<<if $ch09_rhen_answered_toma>>
    @mark rhen jetty_end_rhen walk
<<endif>>
@wait 5.0
<<set $ch15_toma_carried_tobin = true>>
@letterbox off
===
